OL,4,BNFL great Brady could buy Chelsea stake
OL,5,GAmerican football great Tom Brady is   
OL,6,Glooking to invest in Chelsea through   
OL,7,Gownership group Clearlake Capital.     
OL,9,FThe seven-time Super Bowl winner has   
OL,10,Frecently divested his stake in         
OL,11,FChampionship club Birmingham City,     
OL,12,Fwhich he bought into following Tom     
OL,13,FWagner's Knighthead Capital takeover   
OL,14,Fin 2023.                               
OL,16,FIt now appears he could move into      
OL,17,FChelsea, where he has a positive       
OL,18,Frelationship with influential co-owner 
OL,19,FBehdad Eghbali, having been a star     
OL,20,Fguest at the after-party following the 
OL,21,Fclub's Club World Cup triumph in 2025. 
